					["version"] = 20230211,
					["warnings"] = "This profile is missing support for generic trinkets.  It is recommended that every priority includes either:\n - [Use Items], which includes any trinkets not explicitly included in the priority; or\n - [Trinket 1] and [Trinket 2], which will recommend the trinket for the numbered slot.\nImported 3 action lists.\n",
